1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,860
May solar ka, pero may
Meralco bill ka pa rin?

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:05,700
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,800
Sa typical
self-consumption setup,

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:13,510
tumutulong ang solar sa
daytime electricity use mo.

5
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:15,996
Pero kapag kulang
ang solar generation,

6
00:00:16,076 --> 00:00:18,306
o gabi na at wala
kang battery,

7
00:00:18,386 --> 00:00:21,176
puwede ka pa ring kumuha
ng kuryente sa grid.

8
00:00:21,476 --> 00:00:24,626
May mga bill charges din
na hindi basta nawawala.

9
00:00:24,876 --> 00:00:28,986
Kaya hindi dapat mangako
ng automatic zero bill.

10
00:00:29,386 --> 00:00:34,796
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

11
00:00:35,146 --> 00:00:37,626
Life is SoLight with Solar.
